{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2021-04-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES® DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'DENVER, APRIL 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: PEAK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON MAY 21, 2021, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 10, 2021.'}